evious race.\n\n3) **Usefulness:** shifted this way, they describe how well a team has done in the season so far. Since the F1 introduction names car performance as the dominant factor in most eras, a team's standing before the race is a strong candidate for a constructor form feature in Section 3. The introduction also notes that the constructors' championship only started in 1958, so we expect no constructor standings before then; we check this when building the feature.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"standing_years = raw[\"races\"][raw[\"races\"][\"raceId\"].isin(df[\"raceId\"])][\"year\"]\nprint(\"First season with constructor standings:\", standing_years.min())\nprint(\"Races before 1958:\", (raw[\"races\"][\"year\"] < 1958).sum())","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-14T13:15:53.58082Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-14T13:15:53.581569Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-14T13:15:53.589439Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-10-14T13:15:53.581535Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-14T13:15:53.588714Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"First season with constructor standings: 1958\nRaces before 1958: 64\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":33},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"The output below confirms the F1 introduction: constructor standings start in 1958, so the 64 races held before then have none, which a constructor form feature will have to handle.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"**lap_times**","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"df = raw[\"lap_times\"]\ndf.info()\ndisplay(df.head())","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-14T13:38:11.809446Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-14T13:38:11.809842Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-14T13:38:11.877171Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-10-14T13:38:11.809814Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-14T13:38:11.876354Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"<class 'pandas.core.frame.DataFrame'>\nRangeIndex: 58