in number; the audit will show it. `milliseconds` holds the same information as a whole number for every row.\n\n4) **Available before the race?** No. Pit stops happen during the race, and the brief explicitly lists them as not allowed as features. We do not use this table for features or for the three questions.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"","metadata":{"trusted":true},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null}]}